{
  "title": "Within-visit systolic\u2013diastolic cofluctuation does not improve cross-cycle HbA1c prediction",
  "abstract": "Among 4,434 NHANES 2011\u20132012 adults and 4,758 separately sampled 2013\u20132014 adults, adding a normalized paired-pressure covariance feature to demographic, anthropometric, mean-pressure, pulse, marginal-variability and drift predictors did not convincingly improve concurrent HbA1c prediction. Target weighted MSE increased 0.00043423 (+0.0572%); conditional 95% PSU bootstrap interval [\u22120.00056178, 0.00154783], source-plus-target refit interval [\u22120.00064851, 0.00350474]. This is a negative result for one feature/model, not evidence against all vascular\u2013glycemic coupling.",
